# An allowlist, not a blocklist: ignore everything, then let in only what the
# image needs. buschain.db is live user data, and an image is pushed to a
# registry. A blocklist would let through any copy nobody thought to list
# (buschain-old.db, a backup in a subfolder); with an allowlist the database
# can never be baked into an image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!buschain/
buschain/**/__pycache__
